WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.330
In the year 657, a group of Muslims
broke away from the Caliph Ali.

2
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:09.370
They called Muslims who
committed grave sins unbelievers.

3
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:12.920
In 661, one of them killed Ali.

4
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:16.030
So who decides what counts as true Islam,

5
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.530
and what happens to those who disagree?

6
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.890
In this mission, you'll learn
the words for crossing the line,

7
00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.610
from innovation to leaving the faith.

8
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.590
Then you'll compare
declarations on human rights,

9
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:31.460
and ask whether religions can
help settle their own conflicts.

10
00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:35.190
Your mission: find out who
draws the boundaries of Islam,

11
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.560
and how those who disagree are treated.
